            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 140484,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, let's get started on the new click-and-collect service. I've put together a first draft of the end-to-end process map for T1. Please take a look at A1 and share your feedback so we can get it locked in.",
