          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 128135,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Ok I see the map. For the movers, it just says 'Move bulky items to staging'. How do we know when to do this? Do we get a call or is there a list we check?",
            "mentions": [
              140484
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 140484,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Good point. I think the office clerk should send it to keep communication consistent. We'll be watching the tracking sheet, so we'll know when it's ready. What do you think?",
            "mentions": [
              27468
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 140484,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "We'll have a task for that, T9, to define the daily routine. For now, let's just agree on the overall flow in A1. We can iron out the specific triggers later.",
            "mentions": [
              128135
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9",
