          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 27468,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "That works, as long as there's a clear handover. The sales assistant needs to mark the order as 'staged and ready' in the system immediately, so the office clerk has a reliable trigger. If there's a delay, the clerk might notify the customer too early.",
            "mentions": [
