            "reply_to": "M25",
            "text": "Looks like we have a plan. Let's formalize it. Decision: We will use a zoned storage approach (A, B, C, F) and the standard label format will be Order #, Name, Pickup Date, and Piece Count. (D3)",
            "mentions": [
