        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 403118,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hello, here is the draft for the order tracking sheet A2, which covers T5. I've included columns for Order ID, Customer Name, Items, and Status. For filing rules in T12, I suggest we create a digital folder for each day and save the order PDFs there.",
