            "speaker_id": 140484,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "Thanks for getting this started! The sheet looks good, but we need more statuses. I suggest: 'Received', 'Staging', 'Ready for Pickup', 'Completed', 'Cancelled'. This will make tracking much easier. What do you think?",
            "mentions": [
              403118
