            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "For the filing in T12, a folder per day is a good start. We should also define the naming convention. How about 'YYYY-MM-DD_OrderID_CustomerName.pdf'? And we should specify a retention period, maybe 90 days for compliance?",
